<para><computeroutput>void carr_destroy (<link linkend="_structCARR">CARR</link> * vec)</computeroutput></para><para>

<para>Destroys a vector and releases its internal resources. </para>
</para>

<para>Releases resources owned by the vector implementation and invalidates the vector&apos;s internal storage.</para>

